.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4812:
	.ascii	"A SHACL 1.2 sh:memberShape constraint judges every member of a list value node or focus node against a shape (as items); the instance projection carries a list JSON-LD 1.1 converts (Processing Algorithms and API 8.4.2) as its @list array, which the schema judges exactly; a list it keeps as linked @graph nodes (a cell with another property, referenced twice, or an IRI) is a node reference whose members hang off other @graph nodes, and a JSON Schema keyword judges only the instance location it applies to and those beneath it ($ref resolves schemas, never instance values), so for such a value the constraint is not checked."
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4812, 627

