	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4814,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4814,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4814:
	.ascii	"A SHACL 1.2 sh:minListLength constraint bounds the member count of a list value node (as minItems) or focus node (as minItems of its rdf:rest, less its own member); the instance projection carries a list JSON-LD 1.1 converts (Processing Algorithms and API 8.4.2) as its @list array, which the schema judges exactly; a list it keeps as linked @graph nodes (a cell with another property, referenced twice, or an IRI) is a node reference whose members hang off other @graph nodes, and a JSON Schema keyword judges only the instance location it applies to and those beneath it ($ref resolves schemas, never instance values), so for such a value the constraint is not checked."
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4814, 671

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4815,@object
	.section	.rodata.cst8,"aM",@progbits,8
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4815:
	.ascii	"sh:class"
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4815, 8

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4816,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4816,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4816:
	.ascii	"A sh:class constraint on a node shape (one class or a SHACL list of them) judges the focus node's own class membership through the data graph's rdfs:subClassOf* triples, which live on other @graph nodes; a JSON Schema keyword judges only the instance location it applies to and those beneath it, so none reaches them, and the constraint is dropped."
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4816, 348

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4817,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4817,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4817:
	.ascii	"sh:closed sh:ByTypes"
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4817, 20

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4818,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4818,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4818:
	.ascii	"A SHACL 1.2 sh:closed sh:ByTypes constraint permits the properties each value node's own rdf:type values collect through the shapes graph; an object schema states one fixed key set for every instance, so the object is left open and the constraint is dropped (on a property shape, whose value nodes are node references, likewise)."
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4818, 329

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4819,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4819,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4819:
	.ascii	"sh:not"
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4819, 6

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4820,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4820,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4820:
	.ascii	"A sh:not negation whose inner shape is not losslessly expressible as a JSON Schema negation (or that appears at property/value position, where negating a base value schema would be vacuous) is dropped rather than emitted unsoundly."
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4820, 231

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4821,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4821,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4821:
	.ascii	"sh:nodeByExpression"
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4821, 19

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4822,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4822,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4822:
	.ascii	"A SHACL 1.2 sh:nodeByExpression constraint computes its node shape from a node expression evaluated against the data graph; a closed-world JSON Schema has no way to express a shape that is not known until validation time, so the constraint is dropped."
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4822, 251

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4823,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4823,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4823:
	.ascii	"sh:rootClass"
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4823, 12

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4824,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4824,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4824:
	.ascii	"A SHACL 1.2 sh:rootClass constraint bounds class-valued value nodes (or the focus node) by the data graph's rdfs:subClassOf hierarchy; a closed-world JSON Schema cannot consult that hierarchy, so the constraint is dropped."
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4824, 222

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4825,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4825,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4825:
	.ascii	"sh:someValue"
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4825, 12

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4826,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4826,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4826:
	.ascii	"A SHACL 1.2 sh:someValue constraint on a property shape requires at least one of the property's values to conform to a shape; the emitted value schema constrains each value alone, so the constraint is dropped (on a node shape it is projected as sh:node is)."
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4826, 257

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4827,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4827,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4827:
	.ascii	"sh:sparql"
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4827, 9

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4828,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4828,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4828:
	.ascii	"A SHACL-SPARQL constraint (sh:sparql) has no closed-world JSON Schema equivalent and is dropped."
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4828, 96

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4829,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4829,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4829:
	.ascii	"sh:subsetOf"
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4829, 11

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4830,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4830,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4830:
	.ascii	"A SHACL 1.2 sh:subsetOf constraint requires every value to be among the nodes a property path reaches from the focus node; JSON Schema constrains each property on its own and cannot relate one property's values to another path's, so the constraint is dropped."
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4830, 259

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4831,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4831,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4831:
	.ascii	"sh:targetNode"
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4831, 13

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4832,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4832,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4832:
	.ascii	"A shape targeted only via sh:targetNode selects specific focus nodes (a constant, or the output nodes of a node expression), not a class extension; it has no closed-world JSON Schema $def and its constraints are not enforced by the emitted schema."
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4832, 247

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4833,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4833,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4833:
	.ascii	"sh:targetObjectsOf"
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4833, 18

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4834,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4834,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4834:
	.ascii	"A shape targeted only via sh:targetObjectsOf selects focus nodes by a predicate's object position, not a class extension; no closed-world JSON Schema $def can be keyed and its constraints are not enforced."
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4834, 205

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4835,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4835,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4835:
	.ascii	"sh:targetSubjectsOf"
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4835, 19

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4836,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4836,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4836:
	.ascii	"A shape targeted only via sh:targetSubjectsOf selects focus nodes by a predicate's subject position, not a class extension; no closed-world JSON Schema $def can be keyed and its constraints are not enforced."
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4836, 207

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4837,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4837,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4837:
	.ascii	"sh:targetWhere"
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4837, 14

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4838,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4838,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4838:
	.ascii	"A shape targeted via sh:targetWhere selects the nodes that conform to another shape, not a class extension; it has no closed-world JSON Schema $def and its constraints are not enforced by the emitted schema."
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4838, 207

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4839,@object
	.section	.rodata.cst16,"aM",@progbits,16
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4839:
	.ascii	"sh:uniqueMembers"
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4839, 16

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4840,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4840,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4840:
	.ascii	"A SHACL 1.2 sh:uniqueMembers constraint (true: no repeated member; false: only a list) judges a list value node or focus node (as uniqueItems); the instance projection carries a list JSON-LD 1.1 converts (Processing Algorithms and API 8.4.2) as its @list array, which the schema judges exactly; a list it keeps as linked @graph nodes (a cell with another property, referenced twice, or an IRI) is a node reference whose members hang off other @graph nodes, and a JSON Schema keyword judges only the instance location it applies to and those beneath it ($ref resolves schemas, never instance values), so for such a value the constraint is not checked. On a node shape the focus node's own member (its rdf:first) is not compared with the members of its rdf:rest, two instance locations no JSON Schema keyword relates."
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4840, 815

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4841,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4841,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4841:
	.ascii	"sh:uniqueValuesFor"
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4841, 18

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4842,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4842,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4842:
	.ascii	"A SHACL 1.2 sh:uniqueValuesFor constraint forbids two target nodes of a shape from having exactly the same values for the listed properties; a JSON Schema judges one instance alone (uniqueItems is uniqueness within one array, not across instances), so the constraint is dropped."
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4842, 278

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4843,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4843,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4843:
	.ascii	"sh:values"
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4843, 9

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4844,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4844,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4844:
	.ascii	"A SHACL 1.2 property shape with sh:values takes the output nodes of a node expression evaluated at validation as value nodes, which a JSON document does not carry; projecting its constraints onto the document's own values would require what a computed value supplies, so the property shape is dropped."
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4844, 301

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4845,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4845,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4845:
	.ascii	"sh:defaultValue"
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4845, 15

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4846,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4846,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4846:
	.ascii	"A SHACL 1.2 property shape with sh:defaultValue takes the output nodes of a node expression as its value nodes when the property has no other value; a JSON document does not carry them, and projecting the shape's constraints onto the document's own values would require what the default supplies, so the property shape is dropped."
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4846, 330

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4847,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4847,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4847:
	.ascii	"sh:and"
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4847, 6

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4848,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4848,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4848:
	.ascii	"A sh:and constraint on a property shape judges each value node against shapes; a value is projected as a node reference (its own properties live on its separate @graph node) or a literal, so the value schema has nothing to judge and the constraint is dropped."
	.size	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4848, 259

	.type	.Lanon.94405c78b64873a64bd475064fa46f4e.4849,@object
